rem\" class=\"m_1f6ac4c4 mantine-NavLink-label\">Tim List</span><span class=\"m_57492dcc mantine-NavLink-description\"></span></div></a><a style=\"&amp;[data-active]:[object Object]\" class=\"mantine-focus-auto m_f0824112 mantine-NavLink-root m_87cf2631 mantine-UnstyledButton-root\" href=\"/schedule\"><span class=\"m_690090b5 mantine-NavLink-section\" data-position=\"left\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.2rem\" height=\"1.2rem\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"tabler-icon tabler-icon-calendar \" style=\"color:#E64980\"><path d=\"M4 7a2 2 0 0 1 2 -2h12a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v12a2 2 0 0 1 -2 2h-12a2 2 0 0 1 -2 -2v-12z\"></path><path d=\"M16 3v4\"></path><path d=\"M8 3v4\"></path><path d=\"M4 11h16\"></path><path d=\"M11 15h1\"></path><path d=\"M12 15v3\"></path></svg></span><div class=\"m_f07af9d2 mantine-NavLink-body\"><span style=\"font-size:1.1rem\" class=\"m_1f6ac4c4 mantine-NavLink-label\">Schedule</span><span class=\"m_57492dcc mantine-NavLink-description\"></span></div></a></nav><main class=\"m_8983817 mantine-AppShell-main\"><div style=\"--stack-gap:var(--mantine-spacing-md);--stack-align:stretch;--stack-justify:flex-start\" class=\"m_6d731127 mantine-Stack-root\" spacing=\"md\"><h1 style=\"&amp;[data-order=&quot;1&quot;]:[object Object];&amp;[data-order=&quot;2&quot;]:[object Object];--title-fw:var(--mantine-h1-font-weight);--title-lh:var(--mantine-h1-line-height);--title-fz:var(--mantine-h1-font-size);white-space:nowrap\" class=\"m_8a5d1357 mantine-Title-root\" data-order=\"1\">James&#x27;s Gift Ideas</h1><div style=\"--alert-bg:var(--mantine-color-blue-light);--alert-color:var(--mantine-color-blue-light-color);--alert-bd:calc(0.0625rem * var(--mantine-scale)) solid transparent\" class=\"m_66836ed3 mantine-Alert-root\" id=\"mantine-«R5brnmtb»\" role=\"alert\" aria-describedby=\"mantine-«R5brnmtb»-body\" aria-labelledby=\"mantine-«R5brnmtb»-title\"><div class=\"m_a5d60502 mantine-Alert-wrapper\"><div class=\"m_667f2a6a mantine-Alert-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1rem\" height=\"1rem\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"tabler-icon tabler-icon-alert-circle \"><path d=\"M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 18 0a9 9 0 0 0 -18 0\"></path><path d=\"M12 8v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 16h.01\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"m_667c2793 mantine-Alert-body\"><div class=\"m_6a03f287 mantine-Alert-title\" data-with-close-button=\"true\"><span id=\"mantine-«R5brnmtb»-title\" class=\"m_698f4f23 mantine-Alert-label\">Gift-Giving Guidelines</span></div><div id=\"mantine-«R5brnmtb»-body\" class=\"m_7fa78076 mantine-Alert-message\"><ul class=\"m_abbac491 mantine-List-root\"><li class=\"m_abb6bec2 mantine-List-item\"><div class=\"m_75cd9f71 mantine-List-itemWrapper\"><span class=\"mantine-List-itemLabel\">Please don&#x27;t feel any obligation to give gifts - your presence is valued above presents.</span></div></li><li class=\"m_abb6bec2 mantine-List-item\"><div class=\"m_75cd9f71 mantine-List-itemWrapper\"><span class=\"mantine-List-itemLabel\">This list is intended as a helpful guide - we&#x27;d love to be surprised with unexpected and thoughtful gifts we couldn&#x27;t have imagined</span></div></li><li class=\"m_abb6bec2 mantine-List-item\"><div class=\"m_75cd9f71 mantine-List-itemWrapper\"><span class=\"mantine-List-itemLabel\">Second-hand items are welcomed and encouraged</span></div></li><li class=\"m_abb6bec2 mantine-List-item\"><div class=\"m_75cd9f71 mantine-List-itemWrapper\"><span class=\"mantine-List-itemLabel\">Practical/useful items preferred over decorative</span></div></li><li class=\"m_abb6bec2 mantine-List-item\"><div class=\"m_75cd9f71 mantine-List-itemWrapper\"><span class=\"mantine-List-itemLabel\">Help with tasks/time is often more valuable than physical items</span></div></li><li class=\"m_abb6bec2 mantine-List-item\"><div class=\"m_75cd9f71 mantine-List-itemWrapper\"><span class=\"mantine-List-itemLabel\">Consider helping with research/planning when giving money towards items</span></div></li></ul></div></div><button style=\"--cb-size:calc(1rem * var(--mantine-scale));--cb-icon-size:calc(1rem * var(--mantine-scale))\" class=\"mantine-focus-auto mantine-active m_87f54839 mantine-Alert-closeButton m_86a44da5 mantine-CloseButton-root m_87cf2631 mantine-UnstyledButton-root\" data-variant=\"transparent\" type=\"button\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 15 15\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:var(--cb-icon-size, 70%);height:var(--cb-icon-size, 70%)\"><path d=\"M11.7816 4.03157C12.0062 3.80702 12.0062 3.44295 11.7816 3.2184C11.5571 2.99385 11.193 2.99385 10.9685 3.2184L7.50005 6.68682L4.03164 3.2184C3.80708 2.99385 3.44301 2.99385 3.21846 3.2184C2.99391 3.44295 2.99391 3.80702 3.21846 4.03157L6.68688 7.49999L3.21846 10.9684C2.99391 11.193 2.99391 11.557 3.21846 11.7816C3.44301 12.0061 3.80708 12.0061 4.03164 11.7816L7.50005 8.31316L10.9685 11.7816C11.193 12.0061 11.5571 12.0061 11.7816 11.7816C12.0062 11.557 12.0062 11.193 11.7816 10.9684L8.31322 7.49999L11.7816 4.03157Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></button></div></div><div style=\"--stack-gap:var(--mantine-spacing-md);--stack-align:center;--stack-justify:flex-start;padding-block:var(--mantine-spacing-xl)\" class=\"m_6d731127 mantine-Stack-root\" spacing=\"md\"><span style=\"--loader-size:var(--loader-size-lg)\" class=\"m_b34414df m_5ae2e3c mantine-Loader-root\" data-size=\"lg\"></span><p style=\"color:var(--mantine-color-dimmed)\" class=\"mantine-focus-auto m_b6d8b162 mantine-Text-root\">Loading gifts...</p></div><div style=\"--paper-radius:var(--mantine-radius-md);--paper-shadow:var(--mantine-shadow-sm);--card-padding:var(--mantine-spacing-lg);padding:var(--mantine-spacing-lg)\" class=\"m_e615b15f mantine-Card-root m_1b7284a3 mantine-Paper